","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":77.44,"end":81.17,"text":"幸せを数えてみる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":84.47,"end":88.17,"text":"夢を追う君がいる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":88.17,"end":92.38,"text":"でもたまに自信を無くして見える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":92.38,"end":96.72999999999999,"text":"誰かになんと言われようとも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":96.72999999999999,"end":101.13,"text":"君はそのままがいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":101.13,"end":106.38,"text":"メンタルも成長痛を起こすでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":106.38,"end":111.16,"text":"「無理をせず自分らしくいて」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":111.16,"end":114.52000000000001,"text":"それが出来たら悩んでないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":114.52000000000001,"end":118.77000000000001,"text":"まぁ明日こそ笑おう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":118.77000000000001,"end":120.72,"text":"結局は大丈夫","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":120.72,"end":122.86,"text":"この世界はダンスホール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":122.86,"end":127.3,"text":"君の隣で愛を精一杯に探したい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":127.3,"end":129.57,"text":"今日もまた怒られる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":129.57,"end":131.53,"text":"気持ちの穴がポンっと増える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":131.53,"end":137.91,"text":"不器用だけど笑ってもらえるように笑う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":155.76,"end":157.86,"text":"いつだって大丈夫","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":157.86,"end":160.21,"text":"この世界はダンスホール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":160.21,"end":164.69,"text":"楽しんだもん勝ちだ ダンスホール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":164.69,"end":166.53,"text":"また陽が昇る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":166.53,"end":169.12,"text":"時代が周るダンスホール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":169.12,"end":173.37,"text":"足が疲れても